-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 XX002: sift index "r_idx" segment 1 is corrupted | 1 liveness pages, the first block N, have a header or a special space (type, flags, reserved, generation) that is not that of a liveness page of the segment. | A VACUUM of pg_sift 4.2.1 to 4.3.5 could damage the liveness pages of a segment of more than 65,152 superblocks: SELECT * FROM sift.col_repair('r_idx') restores them, REINDEX rebuilds the index.
(1 row)

